                  {
                    "player": "What is this place?"
                  },
                  {
                    "npc": "This is the pass of Shantay. I guard this area with my men. I am responsible for keeping this pass open and repaired."
                  },
                  {
                    "npc": "My men and I prevent outlaws from getting out of the desert. And we stop the inexperienced from a dry death in the sands. Which would you say you were?"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "choice",
                    "options": [
                      {
                        "text": "I am definitely an outlaw, prepare to die!",
