                                    "npc": "Effendi, you insult me! I am not interested in making a profit from you! I merely seek to cover my expenses in keeping this pass open."
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "npc": "There is repair work to carry out and also the men's wages to consider. For the paltry sum of 5 Gold pieces, I think we offer a great service."
